. v, 2, 37) = -दघ्न, W.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["गजद्वयसः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["gajadvayasaH"]}], "gajanakra": [{"id": "gajanakra", "headword": "गजनक्र", "headword_slp1": "gajanakra", "fold": "gajanakra", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गज—नक्र m. ‘elephant-crocodile’, a rhinoceros, Gal.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gajanasa": [{"id": "gajanAsA", "headword": "गजनासा", "headword_slp1": "gajanAsA", "fold": "gajanasa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गज—नासा f. the trunk of an elephant, R. ii, 30, 30.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gajanimilika": [{"id": "gajanimIlikA", "headword": "गजनिमीलिका", "headword_slp1": "gajanimIlikA", "fold": "gajanimilika", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गज—निमीलिका f. (= इभ-न्˚) ‘shutting the eyes (at anything) like an elephant’, feigning not to look at anything, Rājat. vi, 73", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "inattention, carelessness, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gajanimilita": [{"id": "gajanimIlita", "headword": "गजनिमीलित", "headword_slp1": "gajanimIlita", "fold": "gajanimilita", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गज—निमीलित n. (= ˚लिका) feigning not to look at anything, Kād. iii, 1080.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gajapati": [{"id": "gajapati", "headword": "गजपति", "headword_slp1": "gajapati", "fold": "gajapati", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गज—पति m. a lord or keeper of elephants, Siṃhās.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a title given to kings (e.g. to an old king in the south of Jambu-dvīpa), Rasik. vii, 3", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "a stately elephant, Śiś. vi, 55.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["गजपतिः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["gajapatiH"]}], "gajapadapa": [{"id": "gajapAdapa", "headword": "गजपादप", "headword_slp1": "gajapAdapa", "fold": "gajapadapa", "headword_language": "sa", "